        "text": "25"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "26"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Try and check",
        "body": "If each of us put in 4 dimes, the total is $4 \\times 4 + 3 = 19$. If each put in 5 dimes, the total is $4 \\times 5 + 3 = 23$. That is choice A.\n\n**Answer: (A) 23**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Remainder when dividing by 4",
        "body": "The total is (a multiple of 4) + 3, so it leaves remainder 3 when divided by 4. $23 = 4 \\times 5 + 3$ works; 24, 25, 26 leave remainders 0, 1, 2.\n\n**Answer: (A) 23**"
      }
